  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tema_ValeDasChamines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Saneamento na cidade industrial
  _titleEn: Sanitation in the industrial city
  _category: 2
  _unlockTrigger: 12
  _summary: "Saneamento \xE9 levar \xE1gua tratada e coletar e tratar o esgoto. Sem
    ele, a doen\xE7a chega antes do hospital. Renda alta n\xE3o garante rede: a cidade
    pode crescer em volta das f\xE1bricas e deixar os canos para depois."
  _summaryEn: 'Sanitation means delivering treated water and collecting and treating
    sewage. Without it, disease arrives before the hospital does. High income does
    not guarantee pipes: a city can grow around its factories and leave the sewers
    for later.'
  _realWorld: "No Ranking do Saneamento 2026, os 20 melhores entre os 100 maiores
    munic\xEDpios coletam esgoto de 98% da popula\xE7\xE3o; os 20 piores, de 28%.
    O Marco Legal pede 90% at\xE9 2033."
  _realWorldEn: In the 2026 Sanitation Ranking, the top 20 of Brazil's 100 largest
    cities collect sewage from 98% of residents; the bottom 20, from 28%. The legal
    framework calls for 90% by 2033.
  _tradeOffs: "Rede de esgoto \xE9 cara, demora e fica enterrada: o resultado aparece
    na sa\xFAde, n\xE3o na inaugura\xE7\xE3o."
  _tradeOffsEn: 'Sewer networks are costly, slow and buried: the payoff shows up
    in health, not at a ribbon cutting.'
  _sources:
  - Label: Instituto Trata Brasil, Ranking do Saneamento 2026
    Url: https://tratabrasil.org.br/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Release-Ranking-2026_vf.pdf
  - Label: "Ag\xEAncia Brasil, estagna\xE7\xE3o no saneamento (2025)"
    Url: https://agenciabrasil.ebc.com.br/direitos-humanos/noticia/2025-08/estudo-aponta-estagnacao-no-saneamento-5-anos-apos-novo-marco-legal
